  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "雲端計算",
    "sub_ename": "CLOUD COMPUTING",
    "describe_ch": "雲端計算是近年廣受矚目的資通訊技術之一，尤其在於AI與物聯網的整合應用上，扮演著不可輕忽的角色。本課程將介紹雲端計算到邊緣計算的基本發展理念、功能與相關技術，以及實際應用案例。學生可藉由本課程了解到雲與端的基礎知識，與技術的應用。",
    "describe_eh": "Cloud computing is the telecommunications technologies that has attracted much attention in recent years, especially in the integrated application of AI and Internet of Things, and it plays a non-negligible role. This course will introduce the basic development concepts, functions and related technologies from cloud computing to edge computing, as well as practical application cases. Students can learn the basic knowledge of cloud and end, and the application of technology through this course.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
